OL,3,GNEWSALost ancient stone raised up in
OL,4,Avalley
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lost ancient stone, believed to have
OL,7,Fonce been part of a Stone Age tomb, has
OL,8,Fbeen raised.
OL,10,FThe 5-ft (1.5m) stone, which has been
OL,11,Fnamed the Bride Stone, was brought back
OL,12,Finto view at the Valley of Stones
OL,13,FNational Nature Reserve, near
OL,14,FDorchester, Dorset.
OL,16,FIt was discovered during scrub
OL,17,Fclearances carried out at the reserve,
OL,18,Fand raised by local volunteers along
OL,19,Fwith Natural England and community
OL,20,Farchaeology company Past Participate.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
