OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSALost ancient stone raised up in
OL,4,Avalley
OL,5,
OL,6,FRob Beard, reserve manager for Natural
OL,7,FEngland, said: "I'm thrilled to have
OL,8,Fthe Bride Stone standing over the
OL,9,Fvalley. It's a visual testament to all
OL,10,Fthe similar monuments that have been
OL,11,Flost."
